# D3-PO-002: Change the separating liquid, not the plastic sample
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 water 50mL
add v1 PS 0.5g
add v1 PET 0.5g
add v2 water 50mL
add v2 NaCl 8g
add v2 PS 0.5g
add v2 PET 0.5g
measure v1 density
measure v2 density
look v1
look v2
inspect
